# Local/private CMS state must never be committed to the public source repository.
**/.local-demo/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.sqlite3
**/*.sqlite3-*
**/.dev.vars*
**/.env*
**/.wrangler/
**/node_modules/
cms/.github-export/
cms/data/
cms/pdfs/
# Google connection keys stay outside source control.
**/*service-account*.json
**/*credentials*.json
